abstract: >-
  Tesslane is an open source, local-first AI coding agent dashboard for
  Codex and Claude Code. It coordinates feature planning, dependent tickets,
  approvals, native agent execution, Git worktrees, authorized checks and
  independent reviews, with durable local state and delivery evidence.
keywords:
